COMPILATION OF: E48C9

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48C9

   1 a 0000 E48C9:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2c] THE MEMBER COMPARE IN TEST POSITION: `if rec.name = 'EOF' then'.
   4 a 0006 The store battery cannot show the skip byte; E29C4 001C pins the
   5 a 0006 BASED member test as LHLD / XCHG / LXI H,*S / MVI A / ?SCVCM /
   6 a 0006 JNZ, and [C191] pins `=' as C2.  P9 predicts the automatic member
   7 a 0006 test is the same head with LXI H,*D for the member. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 name character(30) varying;
  11 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
  12 c 0006   rec.name = 'AB';
  13 c 0013   if rec.name = 'EOF' then b = '1'b;
  14 c 0027   put list('B=', b);
  15 c 0049   stop;
  16 a 004C end E48C9;

CODE SIZE = 004C
DATA AREA = 0027
FREE SYMS = 386C
END  COMPILATION
